WEBVTT

NOTE From business need to room intelligence (M2, 2:00). The cues are the captions burned into the master (sha256 4578aadab522…),
read from its frames on 2026-11-13; no caption is burned in between 1:09 and 1:18.

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.200
The modern workplace is not a collection of rooms,

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.400
devices, tickets and spreadsheets.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.000
It is one connected system.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.800
Every room has a purpose. Every device has a lifecycle.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.800
Every issue has a history.

6
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.200
And every decision creates information the organization can use again.

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.600
Empathia connects those relationships.

8
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.800
Once deployed, Search Party connects rooms, devices, projects,

9
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.800
people, vendors, documentation and issues.

10
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.200
A room can begin as a business need —

11
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.600
capturing people, workflows, collaboration requirements

12
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.800
and infrastructure before design begins.

13
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.400
Engineering teams can evaluate the request

14
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.400
with comparable designs, cost context, historical outcomes

15
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.800
and AI-assisted recommendations,

16
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.000
while keeping engineering judgment in control.

17
00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:00.400
As the room is built, the same information follows it into commissioning —

18
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.600
from physical installation and network readiness

19
00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:09.200
to audio, video, control and operational acceptance.

20
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:23.400
Automation adds visibility without interrupting the people using the room.

21
00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:27.000
Asset Intelligence shows what the organization owns.

22
00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:30.400
Issue Intelligence reveals how and where it fails.

23
00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.000
Empathia Lite lets employees understand the workplace,

24
00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:38.600
while giving engineers a deeper operational view of the same environment.

25
00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.800
And the lessons learned from operation

26
00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.400
can return to design, commissioning, support and training.

27
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Request. Design. Commission. Operate. Support. Learn. Improve.

28
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:55.200
One system. One source of truth.

29
00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.800
From business need to room intelligence.
